# runs/g2-nvme.json (r8gd.16xlarge: 64 vCPU, 512 GiB, 2x1900 GB instance-store NVMe as RAID0).
# #21 NVMe baseline (regime b: upstream --memory-mapping, pristine) and #23 H-knee regimes (b) and
# (c) (kraken2-madvrandom, diagnostic only), RODA v205, SRR062634.
#
# Workloads (same reads at every thread count of a ladder; prefixes of one real sample):
#   SRR062634_2000000  63 blocks of 8 MiB (inputs.json): the T >= 8 ladder (>= 2 blocks/thread up to T = 31;
#                      T = 48/64 are quantization-limited, shown per rung as ceil(B/T)/(B/T))
#   SRR062634_250000   8 blocks: the T <= 8 ladder (a cold 1-thread rung on 2M pairs would take
#                      hours); T = 8 is on both ladders, so the workload-size effect is measured
# Cheapest rung first: madv before mmap (no read-around), the highest T first (IO-bound: the
# fastest), the small workload's T = 1 last. Rep 1 of everything, then rep 2 of the cold ladders.
# Rung timeout (spec) censors a slow rung and skips the same line's smaller T.
note #21/#23 r8gd.16xlarge NVMe RAID0; regimes mmap (baseline) and madv (diagnostic)
run madv SRR062634_2000000-gz cold 1 64 48 32 24 16 12 8
run madv SRR062634_2000000-gz warm 1 64 8
run madv SRR062634_2000000-fq cold 1 64
run madv SRR062634_2000000-fq warm 1 64 8
run madv SRR062634_250000-gz cold 1 8 4 2 1
run madv SRR062634_250000-gz warm 1 8 1
run mmap SRR062634_2000000-gz cold 1 64 48 32 24 16 12 8
run mmap SRR062634_2000000-gz warm 1 64 8
run mmap SRR062634_2000000-fq cold 1 64
run mmap SRR062634_2000000-fq warm 1 64 8
run mmap SRR062634_250000-gz cold 1 8 4 2 1
run mmap SRR062634_250000-gz warm 1 8 1
# #21 per-accession baseline, 200k pairs each (7 blocks: at most 7 busy threads, T = 64 given)
run mmap SRR062634_200000-gz cold 2 64
run mmap ERR478965_200000-gz cold 2 64
run mmap ERR598966_200000-gz cold 2 64
run mmap SRR28305653_200000-gz cold 2 64
run mmap SRR062634_200000-gz warm 2 64
run mmap ERR478965_200000-gz warm 2 64
run mmap ERR598966_200000-gz warm 2 64
run mmap SRR28305653_200000-gz warm 2 64
# off-CPU / hot-symbol profiles (not timed into any cell)
profile madv SRR062634_2000000-gz cold 64
profile mmap SRR062634_2000000-gz warm 64
profile mmap SRR062634_2000000-gz warm 8
# rep 2 of the cold ladders
run madv SRR062634_2000000-gz cold 1 64 48 32 24 16 12 8
run mmap SRR062634_2000000-gz cold 1 64 48 32 24 16 12 8
run madv SRR062634_250000-gz cold 1 8 4 2 1
run mmap SRR062634_250000-gz cold 1 8 4 2 1
